OL,3,GNEWSAFirst two-week half term for
OL,4,ASurrey council-run schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the first time more than 70 schools
OL,7,Fin Surrey are beginning a two week
OL,8,Fautumn half term holiday from Monday.
OL,10,FA decision to extend the break for a
OL,11,Fweek at community and voluntary
OL,12,Fcontrolled schools, which are run by
OL,13,FSurrey County Council (SCC), was
OL,14,Foriginally made in May 2025.
OL,16,FBut after headteachers raised concerns
OL,17,Fabout the impact, it will go back to
OL,18,Fbeing a one week holiday in the 2027-28
OL,19,Facademic year.
OL,21,FSo will this be the first and only time
OL,22,Fthat this happens?
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
